{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/b7fd9319fe8e4993a35893e9b8583ad0.avif?t=1748775883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras_big/b7fd9319fe8e4993a35893e9b8583ad0.avif?t=1748775883 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in your garage with nothing but a crappy laptop, a few ideas, and dreams of becoming the next indie legend. Your goal: grow into a powerhouse studio making billion-dollar AAA games... or absolute dumpster fires with cult followings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1748775883\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/172a07b31bdf5622e8372f8c5387c74d.webp?t=1748775883\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting out in your garage with nothing but a beat-up laptop and big dreams, you set out to build your studio from the ground up \u2014 one game at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1748775883\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/2d7783553a51a3e738b1887075b232d9.webp?t=1748775883\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your studio grows, you\u2019ll start hiring employees\u2014each with their own skills and quirks\u2014to help turn your ideas into reality. Managing your team becomes just as important as making games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1748775883\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/3dc3d3d35544976e816e81427a9dbcf4.webp?t=1748775883\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your studio from a cramped garage to a high-tech headquarters. Invest in better equipment, bigger spaces, and cool perks to boost your team\u2019s creativity and output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >